{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港鐵表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。現時港島綫列車服務受阻，來往堅尼地城站及柴灣站的整體行車時間（總站至總站）預計需要額外5至8分鐘。</p><p>港鐵呼籲，乘客要為行程預留充裕時間。</p><figure><img alt=\"香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199646029176115200561397.jpeg/03MogEqDigzuhTZMPpOuBlnzPqQvMbbOauXw0Wrl8NE\"/><figcaption>香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:03:01.146960+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:51:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T01:57:20.013792+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:56:35.432918+00:00","content_hash":"58dfc728d3e7669a725a61edcc8f0bd751f8a2679f2cee3a1e580890667fa73e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}